<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1490
01:25:30.958 --> 01:25:32.291
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1491
01:25:32.958 --> 01:25:34.208
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1492
01:25:34.708 --> 01:25:35.958
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1493
01:25:36.458 --> 01:25:38.375
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1494
01:25:38.458 --> 01:25:39.833
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1495
