<i>- ♪ Monkey King! ♪
- ♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1497
01:25:44.166 --> 01:25:45.416
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1498
01:25:46.000 --> 01:25:47.125
<i>♪ Monkey King! ♪</i>

1499
01:25:49.708 --> 01:25:52.833
<i>♪ So watch me rise up ♪</i>

1500
01:25:52.916 --> 01:25:55.416
<i>♪ Open the skies up ♪</i>

1501
01:25:55.500 --> 01:25:58.958
<i>♪ And take the world by storm ♪</i>

1502
01:25:59.041 --> 01:26:03.875
<i>♪ I'll flood the dry lands
Low and highlands ♪</i>

1503
01:26:03.958 --> 01:26:10.125
<i>♪ And take the world by storm ♪</i>

1504
01:26:10.208 --> 01:26:12.791
<i>♪ Hey, hey
He'll take the world by storm ♪</i>

1505
